# Test suite, operator tooling, and fixtures aren't needed by the running
# service in either bot/Dockerfile or onboarding/Dockerfile -- both only
# ever `uv sync`/run the package itself. See ISSUES.md's now-closed "Docker
# images ship the test suite, scripts, and fixtures with no .dockerignore"
# Parked Issue.
**/tests/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# bot/-specific: operator CLI tooling and demo/test fixtures never used at
# runtime by the deployed service.
bot/scripts/
bot/fixtures/
bot/SPEC.md
bot/cost.md

# Never let a build context pick up local secrets or machine-specific config
# even though .dockerignore is a second, redundant safety net alongside
# .gitignore and the git-tracked-files-only build context most CI setups use.
.env
**/.env
.env.config
**/.env.config
*.pem
gcp-service-account-key*.json

.git/
.venv/
docs/superpowers/
